ns, fabrics or made up textile articles and machines for applying the paste to the base fabric or other support used in the manufacture of floor coverings such as linoleum； machines for reeling, unreeling, folding, cutting or pinking textile fabrics.', "aktif" = 1;--> statement-breakpoint
